{"repositoryId":1077743880,"availability":"available","full":"santoshrajkumar/kq-lmpc-quadrotor","name":"kq-lmpc-quadrotor","description":" A complete, hardware-ready Python package for Koopman-based Linear Model Predictive Control (LMPC), delivering real-time trajectory tracking for quadrotors using analytical Koopman lifting (no training data required)","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":98,"forks":18,"created":"2025-10-16T17:13:45Z","updated":"2026-08-29T17:16:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["convex-optimization","data-free-koopman","drone","dynamical-systems","koopman-lmpc","koopman-model-predictive-control","koopman-mpc","koopman-operator","koopman-quadrotor","linear-mpc","model-predictive-control","mpc","px4","px4-ros2-gazebo","python-mpc-acados","quadrotor","quadrotor-hardware-python","real-time-control","robotics","se3"],"demo":"https://colab.research.google.com/github/santoshrajkumar/kq-lmpc-quadrotor/blob/main/examples/Notebooks/quick_demo.ipynb","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T09:32:57.458Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T09:32:57.458Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T09:32:57.458Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T13:25:38.401Z","stars":97,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-19T09:32:57.458Z","stars":98,"forks":18}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🚀 KQ-LMPC is the fastest open-source Koopman MPC controller for quadrotors: zero training data, fully explainable, hardware-proven SE(3) control.","⚡ Real-time convex MPC (<10 ms) • ✅ Stability guarantees • 🔧 PX4/ROS2 ready","Real-time control of agile aerial robots is still dominated by slow NMPC or black-box learning-based controllers. One is too computationally heavy, the other is unsafe without guarantees."],"features":["✅ Analytical Koopman lifting with generalizable observables → No neural networks, no training, no data fitting required","✅ Data-free Koopman-lifted LTI + LPV models → Derived directly from SE(3) quadrotor dynamics using Lie algebra structure","✅ Real-time Linear MPC (LMPC) → Solved as a single convex QP termed KQ-LMPC → < 10 ms solve time on Jetson NX / embedded hardware","✅ Trajectory tracking on SE(3) → Provable controllability in lifted Koopman space","✅ Closed-loop robustness guarantees → Input-to-state practical stability (I-ISpS)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/santoshrajkumar/kq-lmpc-quadrotor/blob/main/README.MD","fingerprint":"a9f317dc67207a585ff70f9a93769d5bb23a974cce94322347ec59c898d4b1e8","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T13:25:39.137Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:25:39.137Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🚀 KQ-LMPC is the fastest open-source Koopman MPC controller for quadrotors: zero training data, fully explainable, hardware-proven SE(3) control.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/santoshrajkumar/kq-lmpc-quadrotor/blob/main/README.MD"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a9f317dc67207a585ff70f9a93769d5bb23a974cce94322347ec59c898d4b1e8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/santoshrajkumar/kq-lmpc-quadrotor/blob/main/README.MD","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T13:25:39.137Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-29T17:16:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/santoshrajkumar/kq-lmpc-quadrotor/blob/main/README.MD","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T13:25:39.138Z","hash":"a9f317dc67207a585ff70f9a93769d5bb23a974cce94322347ec59c898d4b1e8","originalBytes":10972,"storedBytes":10972,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:25:39.139Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:35.579Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:35.579Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Apple"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://colab.rese